'''Toda-Joh''' was an [[Anzellan]] member of the biker gang known as the [[Ganguls]].<ref name="The Ganguls" /> When the biker gang expanded into a [[pirate]] gang, Toda-Joh remained one of the Ganguls' second-in-command behind his leader [[Sellaccc Orryak]]. Toda-Joh used a [[vibroblade]] in combat and spoke in a broken form of [[Galactic Basic Standard|Basic]] similar to [[Anzellan (language)|Anzellan]].<ref name="The Jedi Rescue">{{YJA|The Jedi Rescue}}</ref>

